message: "If you reference this voice demonstration or the AI Agent Eval Harness it belongs to, please cite it as below."
title: "Voice extension demo - AI Agent Eval Harness (healthtech)"
abstract: >-
  Trilingual (English / Latin-American Spanish / Brazilian Portuguese) voice
  rendering of one compliant medication-adherence agent turn from the AI Agent
  Eval Harness (healthtech): a measurement-first, cite-or-refuse conversational
  health agent paired with a CI-gated evaluation harness. Three ElevenLabs
  eleven_multilingual_v2 text-to-speech samples demonstrating that the
  citation-or-refuse contract holds across modalities. 100% synthetic data;
  not a medical device.
